LogEntry <|-- SystemJourney
SystemJourney "*" --> "1" World : from
SystemJourney "*" --> "1" World : to
SystemJourney "*" --> "*" Character : travellers
SystemJourney "*" --> "0..1" Ship : ship
Campaign "1" *-- "0..1" Voyage : voyage
Voyage "0..1" --> "0..1" Journey : jump
Voyage "0..1" --> "0..1" SystemJourney : inSystem
Booking "*" --> "0..1" SystemJourney : ticketFor

